1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Hello everyone, do you want to draw a draft on a virtual model and quickly preview the clothing outline?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
In this update, we have launched a new 3D draft pen virtual model function, which will help you easily create a landing.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Using this tool, you can make free collage lines like painting on paper.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
These drafts can not only instantly transform into 3D lines, but also directly generate 2D panels.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Next, let's explore this innovative and efficient workflow together.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
We have prepared a virtual model in the 3D window in advance.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
In the 3D tool bar on the left side of the screen, long press the 3D pen virtual model icon to change this menu.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Then, select the 3D draft pen virtual model tool added to the new one.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
After selecting it, the upper left corner of the 2D window will pop up with the draft window.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Please note that the 3D window will not be opened.

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Please note that the upper left corner of the 3D window will not be opened.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The 3D window will automatically switch to a front view that is optimized for drawing.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:09,000
In this mode, the rotation function of the viewing angle will be limited to ensure the accuracy of the drawing.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
But you can still freely place and balance the picture.

15
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Now let's draw a draft on a virtual model directly.

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Please make sure the type is set as a pen in the draft window.

17
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Finally, you only need to press the mouse button on the model surface and drag it.

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
You can freely draw a line.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The system will carry out smooth processing in real time.

20
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Ensure that the curve you draw is smooth and natural.

21
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Next, I will introduce you to a few practical options in the draft window.

22
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
After the symmetry is used, the line draft is created along the center axis of the model center axis.

23
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,000
It is very suitable for the symmetry style such as making a jacket or a dress.

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Switch to guide.

25
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
This function can actually preview the effect of the draft to be converted to a 3D curve.

26
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,000
The effect of the 3D curve is to bend the control point.

27
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
If the curve is not ideal, you can refer to the guide.

28
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Directly check and adjust the position of the point.

29
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
3D view.

30
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Press the button at the bottom.

31
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
You can quickly switch between the front and back view.

32
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
To effectively complete the outline of the entire clothing.

33
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Let's use these functions in combination.

34
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Let's draw a simple dress.

35
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
First, I will turn on the symmetry and conversion guide function.

36
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Complete the front drawing.

37
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Let's press the left mouse button.

38
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Draw a smooth line according to the virtual model outline.

39
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,000
First, draw the front chest line.

40
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Then draw the side seam line and waist line.

41
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Next, draw the side seam line of the dress.

42
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Then draw the side seam line of the dress.

43
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
And the line of the skirt outline.

44
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Then switch to the back view.

45
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Complete the back line draft.

46
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Complete the back line draft.

47
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:14,000
When drawing the back, you can refer to the front line outline to draw.

48
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Complete the front line outline.

49
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:28,000
If you draw it wrong, don't worry.

50
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Just click on the line draft window.

51
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
The top of the front leather wipe icon.

52
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:39,000
And adjust the brush size between 10 to 100 pixels.

53
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,000
At this time, the mouse will become a double circle round light.

54
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Drag directly on the line that needs to be modified.

55
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Complete the wipe.

56
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,000
When drawing, press the Shift key.

57
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:59,000
You can easily draw straight lines.

58
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:11,000
And the wipe function will only wipe the lines of the current view.

59
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:17,000
After the draft is finished, you can convert it to actual usable data.

60
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Click on the bottom of the window to convert it to 3D pen button.

61
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
At this time, your drawing is complete.

62
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:25,000
At this time, your 3D draft will be drawn in the form of a 3D curve at a moment.

63
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,000
Accurate projection.

64
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
And it is fitted on the model surface.

65
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
At the same time, the system will automatically switch to you.

66
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Edit the 3D pen virtual model tool.

67
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
So you can adjust it immediately.

68
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
It is worth mentioning.

69
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:41,000
If you are drawing continuous lines from the front to the back.

70
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,000
After they are converted, they will automatically merge into a continuous 3D shape.

71
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Finally, you just need to select these generated lines.

72
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Use the flat flat as a panel tool.

73
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:55,000
You can create a 2D clothing version with seam-to-seam relationship with one button.

74
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Today we have explored the new 3D line sketching virtual model function together.

75
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
No need for complicated data calculation,

76
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Directly implement design on virtual models.

77
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:10,000
This is undoubtedly a once-in-a-lifetime workflow innovation.

78
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:13,000
I hope this function can help you.

79
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
With unprecedented speed and freedom,

80
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Easily turn creativity into reality.

81
